{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53409","headline":"云门寺（《禅》作「归云门」） · 灵澈","name":"云门寺（《禅》作「归云门」）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖边归鹤（《禅》作「雁」）唳寥泬，僧房半倚秦峰缺。\n云生幽石何逍遥，泉去疎林几呜咽。\n天寒猛虎叫岩月（《禅》作「雪」），松下无人空有雪（《禅》作「月」）。\n千年像教人不闻，烧（《禅》作「焚」）香独爲鬼神说。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷七，以《古今禅藻集》卷三相校）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵澈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}